1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,330
Welcome to our garden! Let's learn ten flowers.

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:07,000
And please, nobody eat them.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,460
Even if they look like snacks?

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:13,430
First up, a rose. Say rose!

5
00:00:13,945 --> 00:00:15,715
Pretty, but does it bite?

6
00:00:16,231 --> 00:00:19,760
Those are thorns! Look, don't grab.

7
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:23,698
Sunflower! A giant yellow face.

8
00:00:24,698 --> 00:00:26,158
It's taller than Dad!

9
00:00:27,158 --> 00:00:29,098
I am still growing, thank you!

10
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:34,770
See the tulip? It looks like a cup.

11
00:00:35,153 --> 00:00:36,603
A cup for fairies!

12
00:00:36,985 --> 00:00:39,760
No fairy tea today, sweetie.

13
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:44,232
This is a daisy. White petals, yellow middle.

14
00:00:44,916 --> 00:00:46,356
Daisy, will you play with me?

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,760
She says maybe tomorrow!

16
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,140
Meet the lily, with big smooth petals.

17
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:54,720
Lily is my friend's name!

18
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,448
Then give her a flower high-five.

19
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:03,779
Here's a marigold, bright orange and fluffy.

20
00:01:04,779 --> 00:01:05,929
Is it made of gold?

21
00:01:06,929 --> 00:01:09,329
I wish! We'd be rich!

22
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:12,840
A lotus grows in water, on a pond.

23
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,310
Does it need swimming lessons?

24
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:18,713
It has a floating leaf already!

25
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:23,779
Look closely, this red flower is hibiscus.

26
00:01:24,779 --> 00:01:26,519
Hi, biscuit! Are you yummy?

27
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:29,519
Hibiscus. No biting flowers!

28
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:32,260
That purple beauty is an orchid.

29
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:35,420
Wow, fancy like Mom!

30
00:01:36,420 --> 00:01:39,404
Finally, someone notices my style!

31
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:43,315
Smell this tiny white jasmine flower.

32
00:01:43,917 --> 00:01:46,477
Mmm! Better than Dad's old socks.

33
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:49,760
Hey! My socks are famous!

34
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:52,225
Quick quiz! Rose, sunflower, tulip, daisy, lily!

35
00:01:52,545 --> 00:01:56,296
Marigold, lotus, hibiscus, orchid, jasmine!

36
00:01:56,616 --> 00:01:59,760
We learned ten flowers! Now snacks, please!
